STATELESS APPLICATION
=========================

* It can't store the data permanently.
* The word STATELESS means no past data.
* It depends on non-persistent data means data is removed when Pod, Node or Cluster is stopped.
* Non-persistant mainly used for logging info (ex: system log, container log etc).
* In order to avoid this problem, we are using STATEFUL application.
* A stateless application can be deployed as a set of identical replicas, and each replica ca handle incoming requests independently without the need to coordinate
with other replicas.



